            </note>
            <note corresp="#d335-f4" n="4" xml:id="d335-f4-content">
                <p>D. Protitch, Principal Director of the Department of Security Council Affairs, UN
                    Secretariat.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d335-f5" n="5" xml:id="d335-f5-content">
                <p>Repeated to The Hague and Paris on October 30.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
